<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details 1996 sales, exports.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details 1996 sales, exports.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its domestic and export sales for 1996. Figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>    Item			 1995		     1996</p>
<p>   Total			26,151		   33,071</p>
<p>   Domestic Sales*	  17,750		   21,462</p>
<p>     Petroleum Products   14,881		   17,875</p>
<p>     Natural Gas		 984		    1,615</p>
<p>     Chemicals		 1,886		    1,973</p>
<p>   Export Sales		8,401		   11,609</p>
<p>     Crude Oil		 7,480		   10,705</p>
<p>     Petroleum Products	489			416</p>
<p>     Natural Gas		  12			 32</p>
<p>     Chemicals		   420			457</p>
<p>Note: Statement is unaudited, *gross sales at consumer prices, includes indirect taxes</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903))</p>
</text>
